    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        991,
        1881,
        1205
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York has had a deep concern with the problems and needs of the handicapped including the need to utilize their skills and abilities and in pursuance of that concern, on April 8, 1968, I created the Mayor's Advisory Committee on the Handicapped, so that I might be informed of these problems and needs; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.324,
          "min": -1.6359
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 77,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0789
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16782,
        "area_px": 346894,
        "density": 0.04838,
        "chars": 330,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.66
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        167,
        1225,
        1915,
        1403
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, our experience with the Advisory Committee has demonstrated that City services need to be broadly expanded in order to meet these problems and needs and to facilitate the right of the handicapped to fair employment, access to public accommodations and decent housing; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.289,
          "min": -1.5982
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0331
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16644,
        "area_px": 294590,
        "density": 0.0565,
        "chars": 280,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.82
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        167,
        1417,
        1893,
        1597
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, our handicapped citizens are making positive contributions to the life of the City and it is necessary and desirable to help them make their full potential contribution to society by utilizing their vast reservoir of talent; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2572,
          "min": -1.5179
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0015
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13238,
        "area_px": 293940,
        "density": 0.04504,
        "chars": 237,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        171,
        1611,
        1923,
        1759
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, in order to meet these needs it is necessary to provide for greater cooperation, communication and coordination of our services to the handicapped on a City-wide basis;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2639,
          "min": -1.3993
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 34,
          "mean": -0.0023,
          "min": -0.07
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10544,
        "area_px": 245828,
        "density": 0.04289,
        "chars": 177,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.79
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        171,
        1765,
        1970,
        1880
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as the Mayor of the City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2457,
          "min": -1.6107
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 28,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0337
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5526,
        "area_px": 191015,
        "density": 0.02893,
        "chars": 112,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        171,
        1886,
        1927,
        2122
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There shall be created in the Office of the Mayor, the New York City Mayor's Office for the Handicapped, to be located in the Office of the Deputy Mayor - City Administrator and directly accountable to the Mayor. The Office shall be headed by a Director who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2741,
          "min": -1.4879
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.2813,
          "min": -0.2813
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 70,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0162
        }
      },
